ref\":\"d18\"},\"ref\":\"d18\",\"snippet\":\" ... Midwestern life, the detailed character studies brought to life by kids who seem like real kids (and talk like them too), and the chemistry among the leads.\\n\\nThrough clever casting, reminiscent filmmaking techniques, authentic costumes, and an avalanche of pop culture references, the award-winning show became a ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.rd.com/list/teen-tv-shows/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d16\"},\"ref\":\"d16\",\"snippet\":\" ... Dracula (1992), or the entire cast of Everything Everywhere All at Once (2022) having to play multiple versions of their characters who exist across the multiverse. However, there have been occasions in TV shows where an actor was recast in a completely unrelated role without the audience even ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/actors-multiple-characters-same-tv-show/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"54b4de106e8541753c8aa9ce4f27525a5ddac97f8ccfa15f6bfb87fedfc6281f\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"a720aece8d9aa259ef363ee8cd2e1fcd52ac43107f64285233cd14e736112c82\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"TV show cast real life siblings relatives playing unrelated characters\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_d30c77526afa4f8ab86bf2e1"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d139\"},\"ref\":\"d139\",\"snippet\":\" ... of their cast members look no further than NCIS. The episode that was dedicated to the memory of Mr. McCallum allowed not only the cast and crew to grieve his passing and celebrate his life, but also allowed us, the long-time fans of the actor and show ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvline.com/lists/how-tv-shows-handled-death-of-an-actor/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... the real-life serial killer Ted Bundy. With his career blossoming, he played a role in the 1986 theatrical film Let's Get Harry and the lead role in the 1987 comedy Summer School, again co-starring with Kirstie Alley and alongside future JAG and NCIS alum Patrick ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Harmon\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d140\"},\"ref\":\"d140\",\"snippet\":\" ... NCIS Casts Young Abby for Origin Episode Full of 'Prizes' for Longtime Fans TV Line 23 February 2013 December 9, 2012\\nvoice: Betsy Moore (NCIS: The Video Game) Behind The Voice Actors September 25, 2017 . Check mark indicates role has been confirmed using screenshots of closing credits and ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_NCIS_characters\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d141\"},\"ref\":\"d141\",\"snippet\":\" ... Still don't understand a top rated show going off the air when all the actors were still wanting to do it.\\n\\nMagnum, Todd, NCIS Hawaii an Blue Blood.\\n\\nSo Help Me Todd on CBS… it was clever and entertaining. Awesome cast. Had miles left in it.\\n\\nI ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvline.com/lists/tv-shows-ended-2024-cancelled-list/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d142\"},\"ref\":\"d142\",\"snippet\":\" ... Los Angeles, another Long Runner, has longest-serving cast members Chris O'Donnell, LL Cool J, and Daniela Ruah getting older during the show's entire tenure as well, with them first appearing in a NCIS backdoor pilot when they were 38, 41 and 25 years old respectively ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CharacterAgedWithTheActor\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"be2c75ee05e475a051390e5c80e80ddce5503dd798f79504a011430acab6d052\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"7fb0e9ca48b114762bc9b7c5603f4b1d0aad1bb85738630323f18bf280f2aba0\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"NCIS actor real life relative cast member\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... Harmon's character of NCIS Special Agent Leroy Jethro Gibbs was introduced in a guest starring role in two episodes of JAG. From 2003 to 2021, Harmon starred in the spinoff NCIS as the same character.\\n\\nEarly life\\n\\nHarmon was born in Burbank, California, the youngest of three ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Harmon\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d143\"},\"ref\":\"d143\",\"snippet\":\" ... The show became a massive hit thanks to its cast, led by Mark Harmon.\\n\\nNCIS is among the longest-running scripted live-action TV shows currently airing.\\n\\nIn 2025, NCIS is among the longest-running scripted live-action TV shows currently airing, behind only the two Law & Order ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/longest-running-tv-shows-ever/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d144\"},\"ref\":\"d144\",\"snippet\":\" ... Bellisario to cast him as the flinty NCIS agent Leroy Jethro Gibbs on \\\"NCIS.\\\" The series became a runaway hit for the Tiffany Network and something of a cottage industry for Harmon, who began serving as producer for the series in 2008 and for its spin-off, \\\"NCIS ... \",\"title\":\"https://tv.apple.com/us/person/mark-harmon/umc.cpc.2ztbyn34f7l3ydyg38zzjzp7h\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d140\"},\"ref\":\"d140\",\"snippet\":\" ... ofepisodes (credited) | Notes |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| Cast | Character | Rank/position | Regular | Recurring | Guest | First episode | Last episode | No. ofepisodes (credited) | Notes |\\n| Mark Harmon | Leroy Jethro Gibbs | NCIS Supervisory Special Agent / Marine Gunnery Sergeant | 1–19 | | | \\\"Yankee White\\\" (1.01) | \\\"Great Wide Open\\\" (19.04) | 435 | |\\n| Sasha Alexander | \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_NCIS_characters\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d145\"},\"ref\":\"d145\",\"snippet\":\" ... And on March 15, 2016, the long-running CBS Navy crime drama \\\"NCIS\\\" joins them.\\n\\nSince its inception in 2003, \\\"NCIS\\\" has maintained both a huge American audience and four of its original cast members (Mark Harmon, Michael Weatherly, Pauley Perrette and David McCallum). Sean Murray joined the ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbsnews.com/pictures/ncis-longest-running-scripted-tv-shows-of-all-time/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"bcd1171915e320498a4c5653f428c07412862296b34cfd4ed70e0a00d54083a5\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"060fb56e519168ebe21aec00afe9f3f49bbe1d945198982697fc7d98a115f8a2\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Mark Harmon real life relative NCIS cast\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 1993, he appeared in one episode in the role of a rodeo clown on the CBS comedy/western series Harts of the West with future NCIS castmate Sean Murray.\\n\\nIn 1995, Harmon starred in the ABC series Charlie Grace, in which he portrayed a private investigator. The ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Harmon\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d140\"},\"ref\":\"d140\",\"snippet\":\" ... Sarah McGee\\n\\nSarah McGee (portrayed by Sean Murray's real-life stepsister Troian Bellisario) is the younger sister of Timothy McGee. She makes two quick cameos in Seasons 2 and 3 before making a full appearance in \\\"Twisted Sister\\\".\\n\\nTess Monroe\\n\\nTess Monroe (Sarah Clarke) is an FBI ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_NCIS_characters\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d145\"},\"ref\":\"d145\",\"snippet\":\" ... And on March 15, 2016, the long-running CBS Navy crime drama \\\"NCIS\\\" joins them.\\n\\nSince its inception in 2003, \\\"NCIS\\\" has maintained both a huge American audience and four of its original cast members (Mark Harmon, Michael Weatherly, Pauley Perrette and David McCallum). Sean Murray joined the ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbsnews.com/pictures/ncis-longest-running-scripted-tv-shows-of-all-time/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d146\"},\"ref\":\"d146\",\"snippet\":\" ... Weatherly), the brilliant forensic scientist Abby Sciuto (Pauley Perrette), and the skilled and steadfast agents Ziva David (Cote de Pablo) and Timothy McGee (Sean Murray).\\n\\nAudiences hold their breath as the team delves into the heart-pounding details of each case, which often leads to adrenaline-soaked investigations ... \",\"title\":\"https://collider.com/the-most-popular-tv-shows-of-the-2000s-according-to-imdb/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d142\"},\"ref\":\"d142\",\"snippet\":\" ... and raising a stepdaughter).\\n\\n- NCIS, because of its Long Runner statusnote and most of the cast are notable for sticking around for yearsnote , has the main cast growing older and older day by day, with notably the longest serving cast members Sean Murray and Brian Dietzen joined when ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CharacterAgedWithTheActor\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"68e2259e9c3fbb1d8da983df86339f9b26b015ec4086010fb0f948b8d3c52931\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"c9db8ae0d301796091b7e6cbdcc92627f7da40d7215af4a2365513e6f43d591f\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Sean Murray Murray NCIS real life relative\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_80ccff4d4d0c431b9194d8b4"},{"content":null,"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"ref\": \"d140\", \"goal\": \"Sarah McGee Troian Bellisario Sean Murray real-life stepsister Timothy McGee\"}","name":"read"},"id":"call_ac46d021c5734b4c9cddc4e1","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"evidence\":{\"document\":\"d140\",\"document_chars\":207148,\"end\":186805,\"kind\":\"raw_evidence\",\"ref\":\"e1\",\"sha256\":\"35822304490ca64dc3755d84e0c4eb43d61d6750a92b544ff54d12e149cd48a2\",\"snapshot\":\"1ec693d83ee7b1f4ca3fbcee50f6b33b35e048c7cc5a6d55d7ad5995be758228\",\"start\":183805,\"text\":\"John McGee\\n\\nAdmiral John McGee (Jamey Sheridan) is the father of Timothy McGee. He appears in \\\"Squall\\\", where it is revealed that he has cancer. In \\\"House Rules\\\", ADM McGee passes away.\\n\\nSarah McGee\\n\\nSarah McGee (portrayed by Sean Murray's real-life stepsister Troian Bellisario) is the younger sister of Timothy McGee. She makes two quick cameos in Seasons 2 and 3 before making a full appearance in \\\"Twisted Sister\\\".\\n\\nTess Monroe\\n\\nTess Monroe (Sarah Clarke) is an FBI Senior Special Agent. After working with Tobias Fornell, Monroe joins NCIS in the hunt for British spy Jacob Scott during season thirteen. She participates in a shootout with the NCIS team that results in the intentional death of Trent Kort. Executive Producer Gary Glasberg described Monroe as \\\"full of fire and cynicism and sarcasm and wit and energy and is extremely experienced\\\". Tess has been divorced multiple times, but has no children. She \\\"thinks of her team as her family. She's no-nonsense on the outside, but has a big heart underneath with a belief in honor, justice and doing what's right. She'll fight to protect the values she holds dear, and her team, with determination and a bit of sarcasm\\\".\\n\\nLeroy Jethro \\\"LJ\\\" Moore\\n\\nLeroy Jethro \\\"LJ\\\" Moore (Billy Dee Williams) is the childhood friend of Jackson Gibbs and his future wife Ann — Jethro Gibbs's parents. They were all friends growing up together. Jackson and LJ both fell in love with Ann, but Jackson married her. LJ is \\\"The Namesake\\\" of Jethro Gibbs, and according to Jethro, it was LJ who inspired him to join the Marine Corps as a teenager. LJ stands next to Jethro Gibbs at Jackson's funeral in Season 11's final episode \\\"Honor Thy Father\\\".\\n\\nThomas Morrow\\n\\nThomas Morrow (Alan Dale) is the Director of NCIS until the beginning of season three. He first appears in the NCIS two-part pilot episodes, \\\"Ice Queen\\\" and \\\"Meltdown\\\", before making his official debut in the season one episode, \\\"Yankee White\\\", with his final appearance as NCIS Director in the season three opener \\\"Kill Ari (Part I)\\\", when he leaves to accept an appointment as a Senior Division Chief in the Department of Homeland Security. He appears in several episodes during seasons one and two, but unlike his replacements, Directors Shepard and Vance, Morrow himself is not part of the main cast, and is credited as either a recurring character or a guest star. He has less direct involvement with the team's cases than either of his successors (exceptions being matters of terrorism and national security), and seems to spend much of his time in MTAC monitoring NCIS' global presence. While he seems to like Gibbs, he is less tolerant of Gibbs' personal style and methods than Jenny or Vance; he has a deeply serious, almost stern demeanor, and Gibbs only ever refers to him as \\\"sir\\\". This is probably due to Gibbs being a former Gunnery Sergeant / Scout-Sniper in the U.S. Marine Corps. and Morrow being a former Rear Admiral in the U.S. Navy. He reappears in his Homeland Security positio\"},\"executed\":true,\"next_start\":186805,\"ok\":true,\"previously_received\":false,\"selection\":{\"block_truncated\":false,\"end\":186805,\"instruction\":\"Check the subject and adjoining context; lexical overlap does not establish the requested relation.\",\"matched\":true,\"matched_terms\":[\"sarah\",\"mcgee\",\"troian\",\"bellisario\",\"sean\",\"murray\",\"real\",\"life\",\"stepsister\",\"timothy\"],\"method\":\"paragraph-lexical-v1\",\"score\":35.